# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Never commit real values (`.env` is git-ignored).
#
# One NaN key = ONE Clef request in flight at a time. A second concurrent
# request gets HTTP 429, so every process using the key must share one queue.
NAN_KEY=

# Which model each action uses lives in config.json (see config.example.json).
# The allowlist itself is a constant in code, not configurable (AGENTS.md).
# An env var may still override a single action for one run, e.g.
#   NAN_MODEL_EXPLORE=deepseek-v4-flash ./bin/gfi
# Valid values are only: clef, deepseek-v4-flash, glm5.3-flash,
#                        mimo-v2.6-flash, gemma4, qwen3.6
